# D3-SU-005: Carbon allotropes can have very different electronic behaviour
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
add v1 graphite 1g
add v2 diamond 1g
add v3 Cu 1g
add v4 PE 1g
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
measure v3 conductivity
measure v4 conductivity
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
